  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14221505/assets/ab745b7220264fbf24032104e9ae60d4ffe0b7a58ce1d9a88d1d16ab4c23f9cc.png)\n\nLet $T=\\{-2,-1,0,1\\}.$ The graph above shows the value of $g(x)$ for each $x\\in T.$ Assuming that all the dots have integer coordinates, compute the following:\n\n${max}_{x\\in T}g(x)=$\n{{field-1}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in T}g(x)=$\n{{field-2}}\n\n${min}_{x\\in T}g(x)=$\n{{field-3}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in T}g(x)=$\n{{field-4}}",
